=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ff386dbdf491f489ddccde7d875425e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f5a6167a/uploads/origins/e2b0818a-c55e-4033-be2e-2b3f4c4a39d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c82e11249a340562e3d303ccd388a75e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, I love your art style and was hoping to get an art piece drawn by you!\n\nCould you please draw my character (Yoshabie) and my prom date, (Arkomi), sitting happily on a bench outside on a date? I'm looking for our outfits to be similar to the dresses and suits in the \"Christmas Ball\" reference and I am looking for the background to be winter and have snow and lights. \n\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IGQu1YcmAeXi8h6V57AIeEO_goggA55Y?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@aaa98752/works/79", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2760d6d/uploads/origins/af4d3693-290c-488a-ace9-72127dea2e72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8c6f60c3dfaa8dc21c34cbd288eace62", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2760d6d/uploads/origins/af4d3693-290c-488a-ace9-72127dea2e72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8c6f60c3dfaa8dc21c34cbd288eace62, https://si.imgix.net/e2760d6d/uploads/origins/af4d3693-290c-488a-ace9-72127dea2e72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7fdbc440219efcf9da3c14a3a51c4c3c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e2760d6d/uploads/origins/af4d3693-290c-488a-ace9-72127dea2e72?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=mi